    "Could not save “%@”: %@\nYour content is still in the editor. Please try again." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "保存“%1$@”失败：%2$@\n内容仍保留在编辑器中，请重试。" } } } },
