    "“%@” contains %lld items. Deleting it permanently removes the folder and all its contents. This action cannot be undone." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“%1$@”包含 %2$lld 个项目。删除将永久移除该文件夹及其全部内容，此操作不可撤销。" } } } },
    "“%@” was changed in another app while your edits are unsaved. Choose which version to keep." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“%@”已在另一个程序中修改，而当前编辑尚未保存。请选择处理方式。" } } } }
